hability \ufeffof \ufeffthe \ufeffpost.\ufeff The\ufeff decision \ufeffis \ufeffmade \ufeffconsidering\ufeff the \ufeffdomain \ufeffor \ufeffsubject \ufeffof \ufeffthe \ufeffpost\ufeff and\ufeff retrieving\ufeff data \ufeffassociated\ufeff with \ufeffit \ufefffrom\ufeff the\ufeff web\ufeff at \ufeffregular \ufefftime\ufeff intervals.\ufeff The\ufeff retrieved\ufeff data \ufeffhas \ufeffbeen \ufefftrained \ufeffusing \ufefflogistics \ufeffand\ufeff K-NN\ufeff regression \ufeffto \ufeffclassify \ufeffa\ufeff particular \ufeffinstance \ufeffof \ufeffdata \ufeffand \ufeffidentify\ufeff the \ufeffplatform\ufeff which \ufeffcan \ufeffprovide\ufeff the \ufeffmost \ufeffreachability.\ufeff The\ufeff system\ufeff also \ufeffsuggests \ufeffkeywords \ufeffrelated \ufeffto \ufeffthe \ufefftopic \ufeffof \ufeffthe\ufeff post\ufeff which\ufeff has\ufeff been \ufeffmostly \ufeffused \ufeffin \ufeffrecent \ufefftimes.","topics":[],"score":217799,"global_rank":237719,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":36644},{"name":"stlong0521/chat-bot","owner":"stlong0521","html_url":"https://github.com/stlong0521/chat-bot","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A chat bot under development","topics":[],"score":217797,"global_rank":237728,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":36645},{"name":"jjgoings/YaleCompChem","owner":"jjgoings","html_url":"https://github.com/jjgoings/YaleCompChem","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Submit Gaussian16 jobs on Grace specifically for CHEM426/526","topics":[],"score":217796,"global_rank":237737,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":36646},{"name":"dimejiajasin/Flask_Project","owner":"dimejiajasin","html_url":"https://github.com/dimejiajasin/Flask_Project","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217796,"global_rank":237738,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":36647},{"name":"dstron